    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1721.2399999999998,
    "end": 1751.48,
    "text": "And we don't need another 600-25 foot bike paths straight through my backyard. Put it Frank. I think there's much better uses of the money and could be used to help other people as opposed to a bike path that would provide a little pretty view for the few cyclists. And coming from the youth, a lot of people that have spoken to a lot of VCU students in particular have reached out to me saying that they've emailed, speaking out against this plan."
