    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1752.52,
    "end": 1784.2,
    "text": "Not something that is in the best interest of the youth, high school students, college students. Just younger people as well. We don't need this. Thank you very much. Our next speaker's duty phraseer. Hi, good evening, young. Glad to be here tonight and appreciate your attention to the George Snyder Trail tonight in your work session. I wanted to make a couple comments about it."
