    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1785.24,
    "end": 1817.6399999999999,
    "text": "First of all, I am surprised that we're at this point where there are apparently permits already in hand because this is the NEPA programmatic category. Catagorical exclusion, which says, get this. There has been no public opposition to this project. I'm leaving room to laugh here. Yes, there's been substantial public opposition to this project. This is outdated and should not be part of this permit. Also, it says no substantial controversy on environmental grounds is anticipated."
