    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 1818.1999999999998,
    "end": 1848.4399999999998,
    "text": "That is also very outdated at this point. This project should not go forward with these documents and it's portfolio. Also, I'd like to mention that G-Stag is noted here as a citizen committee involved with project planning. That is also interesting. I was a member of the G-Stag and I can tell you we had nothing to do with planning of the project. When we were formed, it was already more than 30% complete design drawings. So we were not involved in planning."
