    "start": 1849.0,
    "end": 1884.6000000000001,
    "text": "It was not public. We were handpicked. We were invited by Kathy Selgado, director Parkson REC to join this group. It was not public. We met in the city manager's office. It was not advertised. It was not official. It was not a format that we didn't have a chair. We didn't take minutes. Have an agenda. It was very informal. Staff limited our discussion very narrowly to things that were tweaks. You probably have heard this already. We're too far along in this project. We can't do major"
