    "start": 1884.6000000000001,
    "end": 1919.3200000000002,
    "text": "real-eniments. We can do tweaks. We were allowed to do tweaks. I think you will hear that kind of thing tonight. We were not involved in the planning of the project. We did actually do a couple of good things. I think to make a bad project better, but it's still a bad project. So I will say again, it was not public involvement. There was no public engagement. It was not public outreach. None of that happened. People didn't know this project existed when this document was created. Secondly, in the presentation tonight, you're going to be given"
