    "start": 1919.3200000000002,
    "end": 1953.08,
    "text": "three lousy options. I say they're lousy because nothing is very well fought out. You either cancel with having information about what that means or you agree to a partial build, which also don't really know what that means. It hasn't really been fully explored or you go ahead with the whole thing, which we all know what that is about idea. So ask questions, demand answers. You have some colleagues who want to explore more creative"
