    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2197.88,
    "end": 2238.04,
    "text": "Creek Bank and some of you who walked the trail the other day know how that area looks now. Thereby taking out all the urban forest. I mean, those ball fields would have gone right over to the creek and all the trees would have been gone. Instead, we had a compromise in the city council decided to reduce the number of ball fields and build us a lovely walking path through the forest. Somehow, the transportation department took over and had been pushing for this wide paved roadway"
