    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2341.5600000000004,
    "end": 2379.4,
    "text": "city residents have had to this project. The repeated communication goes back more than five years. Over these past years, we kept hearing the design is 65% complete. The design is 90% complete. And now the design is 100% complete. I heard this last excuse from both the mayor and Miss Wendy Saford, Sanford on February 28th when I walked with most of the council, some city staff in the mayor along with the proposed B1 and C1 sections of the proposed trail through the woods. Both the mayor"
