    "speaker": "City Manager David Coll",
    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2446.6,
    "end": 2477.7999999999997,
    "text": "preserves the woods. Thank you. Our next speaker is Haban Abdi. Good evening everyone. I'm a city of Fairfax residents. You've helped me by the way. I remember you well. I've lived here for the last 14 years. As a single woman, I feel safe and I love my home"
