    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2477.96,
    "end": 2510.1200000000003,
    "text": "and I love my life here. But I'm also a numbers person. That's what I do for living. This tax assessment and I have my neighbors here with me, date shows not to speak. So I said, I'll speak up. The first gentleman indicated the tax rate going up and the assessment going up. The sentiment is pretty real. Given the fact that we're all dealing with the price of eggs,"
