    "start": 2510.1200000000003,
    "end": 2543.32,
    "text": "sorry if we're abusing that one inflation, our adjusted incomes are not going up to support this, by the way. We live on a private road, aside from recycling and trash pick up. We really are independent and just maintain our own road. We don't enjoy snow removal. We do not enjoy any other parts of the city that we love. Our lots are adjacent to a V dot own strip of land. Imagine"
