    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2576.2,
    "end": 2630.68,
    "text": "So I feel we're actually taking things off your plate. Please reconsider this. $1300 is untenable. That's net dollars. It's difficult to support it. And for me, I'm feeling as though I'm getting pushed out. Thank you. Our next speaker is Len McPherson. Good evening, everybody. I'm Len McPherson. I live at 3259 Cambridge Court. My home is right across the street"
