    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2631.64,
    "end": 2662.44,
    "text": "from Stafford Drive East. Or if you're familiar with this map, see one. I look out on see one. Live here since 2002. I remember the day I drove into the neighborhood. It was fall. The trees were bursting with colors. And I thought I'm home. I hadn't even looked at the house. But I was home."
