    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2665.48,
    "end": 2698.76,
    "text": "Right now, contractors hired by the city are destroying over 500 trees across the street from our homes. As a result of the stream restoration project, this is the same area that's planned for the George Schneider Trail, which will result in the destruction of 500 additional trees. I really can't describe the level of despair"
