    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 2699.4,
    "end": 2737.56,
    "text": "that I feel when I drive into my neighborhood and see the destruction that's already occurred. And I can't fathom what it's going to feel like when you take another 500 trees from us. It's unbelievable to me. And this group, this group of concerned citizens, has been writing letters, talking to the press, coming to city council meetings, walking the trails"
