    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 3023.48,
    "end": 3054.7599999999998,
    "text": "A through B and the motion accompanying the consent agenda item as printed. A motion for the main bike council member, Stacey Hardy Chandler, is there a second? A motion has been made and seconded by council member Peterson. Are there any items Council would like pull for additional discussion? Seeing none, a roll call book. Council Member McQuillin. I council member Bates. I council member Peterson. Council member Hardy Chandler. All right. Council member Hall. I council member A miss."
