    "speaker_source": "heuristic",
    "speaker_source_detail": "Heuristic (text-based speaker guess)",
    "start": 3121.48,
    "end": 3156.6,
    "text": "10 business point increase on rates and 20% increase on the valuation. But this year, they decided to go 150%, which is something that is insane. How the past of the market bring the bill to the tenants? The ideas for them to survive. The ideas for them to grow. The ideas for them to make money so that they can pay your money. These are all restaurants which means another percentage as far as meal tax is concerned. I don't understand how this"
